  {
    "sha": "00b1480903c056b196ad81ffb3ac0ac70ddcfd82",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOV3jwVtoAKDAwYjE0ODA5MDNjMDU2YjE5NmFkODFmZmIzYWMwYWM3MGRkY2ZkODI",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-23T12:21:58Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-23T12:21:58Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'upstream/main' into issue/3349-engrave-do-not-touch\n\nMerge origin/main (3fc0e017b) and keep both sides where each added work:\n- operation/types/avoid.rs, mcp/tools.rs, docs/agents/mcp-tools.md: \"Do not\n  touch\" now applies to Trace, 2D Offset, 3D Pocket, Face, 3D Finish and\n  Engrave.\n- motion/machining2d/mod.rs: keep mod slot_band and mod trace_avoid.\n- ui/egui_app/tests/do_not_touch.rs: keep main's Finish3D test and the\n  Engrave test.\n\nFix the review finding on the open-run endpoint trim:\n- Add trace_avoid_trims_open_run_endpoints_under_overhead_clearance_blocker\n  to crates/motion/tests/avoid_engrave.rs. It asserts that avoid_hits is\n  empty and that the plunge and retract points are outside the clearance\n  keep-out. A mutation of `endpoints_blocked` makes the test fail.\n\nFix the 400-line note:\n- Move the Engrave UI test to ui/egui_app/tests/do_not_touch_engrave.rs.\n  The two files have 388 and 52 lines; the camcraft-ui test count does not\n  go down.\n\nRefs #3349\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
